
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant App as 💻 App
    participant SDK as 📦 Tevroc SDK
    participant Worker as ⚙️ Tevroc Worker

    User->>App: Enter credentials
    App->>SDK: tevroc.auth.login()
    SDK->>Worker: POST /auth/login
    Worker->>SDK: Token + user payload
    SDK->>App: Authenticated session

    App->>SDK: tevroc.auth.me()
    SDK->>Worker: GET /auth/me
    Worker->>SDK: User profile
    SDK->>App: Current user data
